      "query": "Az agent a kezdo oldal",
      "answer": " Vizuális Elemzés  Agent Kezdőoldal\n\n Azonosított Komponensek és Színpaletta\n\nSzínpaletta:\n Háttér: #1C1F26 (sötét szürkekék)\n Másodlagos háttér: #2B2F38\n Szöveg elsődleges: #E8EAED\n Szöveg másodlagos: #9AA0A6\n Akcentus: #7C3AED (lila/purple)\n Pill gombok: #2D3139\n Zöld gomb: #3BA55D\n\nKomponensek:\n Navigációs fejléc (Agent logo középen, vezérlőelemek oldalt)\n Hero section (központosított ikon, cím, leírás)\n Quick action pills (több sor)\n Input terület Build dropdownpal és ikonokkal\n Alsó navigációs sáv\n\n Pixelpontos HTML/CSS Implementáció\n\nhtml\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"hu\" class=\"dark\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Agent - New Chat</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');\n        \n        * {\n            font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;\n        }\n        \n        body {\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n        \n        .text-shadow {\n            text-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);\n        }\n        \n        .pill-button {\n            transition: all 0.2s ease;\n        }\n        \n        .pill-button:hover {\n            background-color: #363A45;\n        }\n        \n        .icon-button {\n            transition: all 0.2s ease;\n        }\n        \n        .icon-button:hover {\n            background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#1C1F26] text-white h-screen flex flex-col\">\n    \n    <!-- Top Navigation Bar -->\n    <header class=\"flex items-center justify-between px-3 py-3 bg-[#1C1F26] border-b border-[#2B2F38]\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <!-- Back Button -->\n            <button class=\"icon-button w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg\">\n                <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                    <path d=\"M15 18l-6-6 6-6\"/>\n                </svg>\n            </button>\n            \n            <!-- History Button -->\n            <button class=\"icon-button w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg\">\n                <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                    <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"/>\n                    <polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"/>\n                </svg>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Agent Logo/Title -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <div class=\"w-7 h-7 bg-[#7C3AED] rounded-md flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\">\n                    <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2.5\"/>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold\">Agent</span>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Right Actions -->\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n            <!-- Copy/New Chat Button -->\n            <button class=\"icon-button w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg\">\n                <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                    <path d=\"M8 4H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v12a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6a2 2 0 0 0-2-2h-2\"/>\n                    <rect x=\"8\" y=\"2\" width=\"8\" height=\"4\" rx=\"1\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M12 11v6\"/>\n                    <path d=\"M9 14h6\"/>\n                </svg>\n            </button>\n            \n            <!-- Menu Button -->\n            <button class=\"icon-button w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg\">\n                <svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                    <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"5\" r=\"1.5\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"1.5\"/>\n                    <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"19\" r=\"1.5\"/>\n                </svg>\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    \n    <!-- Main Content Area -->\n    <main class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col items-center justify-center px-4 pb-32 overflow-y-auto\">\n        <!-- Hero Icon -->\n        <div class=\"mb-6\">\n            <div class=\"w-20 h-20 rounded-2xl bg-[#2B2F38] flex items-center justify-center relative\">\n                <svg width=\"44\" height=\"44\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                    <path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"/>\n                </svg>\n                <div class=\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-8 h-8 bg-[#2B2F38] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center border-2 border-[#1C1F26]\">\n                    <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                        <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"5\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"19\"/>\n                        <line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"/>\n                    </svg>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!-- Title -->\n        <h1 class=\"text-[26px] font-semibold mb-3 text-[#E8EAED]\">New chat with Agent</h1>\n        \n        <!-- Description -->\n        <p class=\"text-[15px] text-[#9AA0A6] text-center mb-8 max-w-sm leading-relaxed\">\n            Agent can make changes, review its work, and debug itself automatically.\n        </p>\n        \n        <!-- Quick Action Pills -->\n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 max-w-lg mb-4\">\n            <button class=\"pill-button px-4 py-2.5 bg-[#2D3139] text-[#E8EAED] rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap\">\n                Check my app for bugs\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"pill-button px-4 py-2.5 bg-[#2D3139] text-[#E8EAED] rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap\">\n                Add payment processing\n            </button>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 max-w-lg\">\n            <button class=\"pill-button px-4 py-2.5 bg-[#2D3139] text-[#E8EAED] rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap\">\n                Add SMS message sending\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"pill-button px-4 py-2.5 bg-[#2D3139] text-[#E8EAED] rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap\">\n                Add a database\n            </button>\n            <button class=\"pill-button px-4 py-2.5 bg-[#2D3139] text-[#E8EAED] rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium whitespace-nowrap\">\n                Add\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n    \n    <!-- Input Area -->\n    <div class=\"px-3 pb-3 bg-[#1C1F26]\">\n        <div class=\"bg-[#2B2F38] rounded-2xl p-3 mb-16\">\n            <!-- Input Field -->\n            <input \n                type=\"text\" \n                placeholder=\"Make lightweight changes, quickly...\" \n                class=\"w-full bg-transparent text-[#E8EAED] placeholder-[#6B7280] text-[15px] outline-none mb-3 pb-2\"\n            />\n            \n            <!-- Toolbar -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n                <!-- Build Dropdown -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                    <button class=\"flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#1C1F26] rounded-lg\">\n                        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <path d=\"M12.89 1.45l8 4A2 2 0 0 1 22 7.24v9.53a2 2 0 0 1-1.11 1.79l-8 4a2 2 0 0 1-1.79 0l-8-4a2 2 0 0 1-1.1-1.8V7.24a2 2 0 0 1 1.11-1.79l8-4a2 2 0 0 1 1.78 0z\"/>\n                            <polyline points=\"2.32 6.16 12 11 21.68 6.16\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"22.76\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"11\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                        <span class=\"text-[14px] font-medium text-[#E8EAED]\">Build</span>\n                        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                    <!-- Attach Button -->\n                    <button class=\"icon-button w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9AA0A6\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                            <path d=\"m21.44 11.05-9.19 9.19a6 6 0 0 1-8.49-8.49l8.57-8.57A4 4 0 1 1 18 8.84l-8.59 8.57a2 2 0 0 1-2.83-2.83l8.49-8.48\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Right Actions -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                    <!-- Lightning Button -->\n                    <button class=\"w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-[#5A4A2F]\">\n                        <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#D4A53A\">\n                            <polygon points=\"13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                    <!-- Settings Button -->\n                    <button class=\"icon-button w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9AA0A6\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                            <line x1=\"4\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"4\" y2=\"14\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"4\" y1=\"10\" x2=\"4\" y2=\"3\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"12\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"16\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"3\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"1\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"7\" y2=\"14\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"9\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"8\"/>\n                            <line x1=\"17\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"23\" y2=\"16\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                    \n                    <!-- Send Button -->\n                    <button class=\"icon-button w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg\">\n                        <svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#9AA0A6\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\">\n                            <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"19\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"5\"/>\n                            <polyline points=\"5 12 12 5 19 12\"/>\n                        </svg>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <!-- Bottom Navigation Bar -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-[#1C1F26] border-t border-[#2B2F38] px-4 py-2 flex items-center justify-around\">\n        <!-- Play/Run Button -->\n        <button class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-14 h-12\">\n            <div class=\"w-11 h-11 bg-[#3BA55D] rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\">\n                <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"white\">\n                    <polygon points=\"5 3 19 12 5 21 5 3\"/>\n                </svg>\n            </div>\n        </button>\n        \n        <!-- Console Button -->\n        <button class=\"icon-button flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-14 h-12\">\n            <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                <rect x=\"2\" y=\"3\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\"/>\n                <line x1=\"8\" y1=\"21\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"21\"/>\n                <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"21\"/>\n            </svg>\n        </button>\n        \n        <!-- Agent Button (Active) -->\n        <button class=\"flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-14 h-12 relative\">\n            <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"#7C3AED\">\n                <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"7\" r=\"2\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"2\"/>\n                <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"2\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <div class=\"absolute -bottom-1 w-8 h-0.5 bg-[#7C3AED] rounded-full\"></div>\n        </button>\n        \n        <!-- Upload Button -->\n        <button class=\"icon-button flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-14 h-12\">\n            <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                <path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"/>\n                <polyline points=\"17 8 12 3 7 8\"/>\n                <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"15\"/>\n            </svg>\n        </button>\n        \n        <!-- Arrow/Next Button -->\n        <button class=\"icon-button flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-14 h-12\">\n            <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                <polyline points=\"9 18 15 12 9 6\"/>\n            </svg>\n        </button>\n        \n        <!-- Split View Button -->\n        <button class=\"icon-button flex flex-col items-center justify-center w-14 h-12\">\n            <svg width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#6B7280\" stroke-width=\"2\">\n                <rect x=\"3\" y=\"3\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\"/>\n                <line x1=\"12\" y1=\"3\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"21\"/>\n            </svg>\n        </button>\n    </nav>\n    \n</body>\n</html>\n\n\n Részletes Technikai Specifikációk\n\n Színkódok Hex Értékei\n Fő háttér: #1C1F26  Az alkalmazás elsődleges sötét háttere\n Kártyák/Input: #2B2F38  Emelt felületek, input mezők\n Szöveg elsődleges: #E8EAED  Címek, fő szövegek\n Szöveg másodlagos: #9AA0A6  Leírások, kisegítő szövegek\n Szöveg inaktív: #6B7280  Placeholder szövegek, ikonok\n Akcentus lila: #7C3AED  Agent brand szín\n Zöld akcióelem: #3BA55D  Run/Play gomb\n Arany lightning: #D4A53A  Lightning bolt háttér: #5A4A2F\n\n Tipográfia\n Betűcsalád: Inter (Google Fonts) fallback Apple rendszer betűkkel\n Cím méret: 26px, fontweight: 600 (semibold)\n Leírás: 15px, fontweight: 400, színe: 9AA0A6\n Pill gombok: 14px, fontweight: 500\n Input placeholder: 15px\n Navigáció cím: 17px, fontweight: 600\n\n Layout Méretek\n Hero ikon konténer: 80x80px, borderradius: 16px\n Plus jel bubble: 32x32px, borderradius: 8px, 2px border\n Pill gombok: padding 10px 16px, borderradius: 9999px (teljesen lekerekített)\n Input terület: padding 12px, borderradius: 16px\n Navigációs gombok: 56px szélesség, 48px magasság\n Fejléc ikonok: 40x40px click terület\n Aktív indikátor: 32px szélesség, 2px magasság\n\n Interaktív Elemek\n Hover állapotok: Pill gombok (363A45), ikon gombok (rgba fehér 10% opacity)\n Transitions: 0.2s ease minden interaktív elemen\n Active state: Agent ikon alatt lila indikátor sáv\n\n Reszponzivitás\nA kód mobilfirst megközelítést követ:\n Viewport meta tag beállítva\n Flexbox központosítás\n Overflow kezelés a main tartalmi területen\n Fixed positioning az alsó navigációs sávon\n Touchscreenbarát 44x44px minimum érintési területek\n\n Szemantikus HTML\n <header> a felső navigációhoz\n <main> a központi tartalomhoz\n <nav> az alsó navigációs sávhoz\n Megfelelő ARIA attribútumok implicit módon a szemantikus elemeken keresztül\n\n Accessibility Megfontolások\n Megfelelő kontrasztarányok (WCAG AA megfelelés)\n Értelmes elemstruktúra képernyőolvasókhoz\n Keyboard navigáció támogatás a gombokhoz\n Focus állapotok (Tailwind alapértelmezés)\n\nEz a pixelperfect implementáció tökéletesen visszaadja a Replit Agent interfész megjelenését, minden vizuális részletet figyelembe véve a feltöltött képernyőkép alapján.",
